Package: gospot-radio
Version: 0.2.0-2
Architecture: armhf
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Maintainer: GoSpot <noreply@localhost>
Depends: libi2c0, libsamplerate0, libcrypt1, libstdc++6, curl, procps, python3, unzip,
 libwxbase3.2-1t64 | libwxbase3.2-1, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libusb-1.0-0, libusb-0.1-4
Provides: pistar-radio
Replaces: pistar-radio
Conflicts: pistar-radio
Description: GoSpot radio services, Pi-Star compatible
 Pi-Star PS4 builds of MMDVMHost, DMRGateway and the YSF/P25/NXDN/DAPNET/M17
 gateways, the Pi-Star sbin tools and service handlers renamed for GoSpot,
 systemd units for them and a daily host-file update, and the D-Star daemons
 (ircDDBGateway, DStarRepeater, TimeServer, ...) rebuilt for wxWidgets 3.2.
 No PHP. Radio units are not enabled on install. Replaces the pistar-radio
 package and moves its layout (/var/log/pi-star, /etc/pistar-*) to GoSpot.
